  <item>
    <title>VOL.09 | 摄影不是我的信仰</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/688c8ff7edf3fa32d59f0d36</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">688c8ff7edf3fa32d59f0d36</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Aug 2025 10:04:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：Wilde</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：奥利奥</span></p><span></span><p><span>和Wilde相识于深圳南播湾播客线下活动，本期和他聊了聊过往的摄影经历和难忘的照片故事，同时他也是一位资深猫奴，养猫的时间比拍照还长，有两只很可爱的猫猫Bobo和豆腐。（附美图）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgU1zQrJRCxSz1_Cmpvteu86yar8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh7EDGMSKCQvecLr2IgQp6ftHEVU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>常用相机：PENTAX MZ-60，GR3</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmRftP1Vzp5brxls744DQsGRcBBp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>📸本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 【照片分享】上海浦东美术馆内的一块展示屏 &nbsp;&nbsp;这个场景犹如一个无需思考，众人接受神通过窗口发布的思想即可的时代</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg5KGdmACLqWCqsjbqlxB8elRwKA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> 【照片分享】荷花的枯枝败叶 ，记录消极场景的意义在于给情绪低落的人通过与图片同情的方式提供一些支持</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlRB6O3dWrvaMFlWZE50fujzt6s_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="679">11:19</a> 【照片分享】人造的堤坝在画面中融合了自然的山海与没有用的荒地，包容无所事事的情景是体现善良的一种方式</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq2G20u6ZQe45tTNiGcbHPAZ5Ne4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 【照片分享】拍摄者的糖水片巅峰，野菊花蓬勃的生命力需要摄影技术来表现（成功投稿VOGUE）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhtNx65tWi2Nft-RwHOULNSgWWh5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 【照片分享】当我看到这个山坡的时候，我想一定要记录下来这远离城市喧嚣的瞬间</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkxdGvr2bjVVBHdbu-JaQQSYJ49K.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> 【照片分享】不论什么样的人生，都会有需要在一个地方坐一坐的时刻</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrOyDF95p4qqD0t8m0DktwRTCgWa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1636">27:16</a> 【照片分享】那个特殊的时期，即使在明亮的阳光下依然无处可去的处境</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs2l9pAcHqVhReQ3Y7BF45lUUmh1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1794">29:54</a> 【照片分享】2019真实的皖北农村</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgDOaIlhFpGTT6PRhq5gye1ajigH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1818">30:18</a> 【照片分享】当一个老人看着居住一生的房子即将被拆掉时，背影中的情绪胜过脸上的千言万语</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frt7GLX8HgLc1jGKO-JICHvOADIr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">33:01</a> 摄影的启蒙是从表妹奶奶在照相馆做冲洗开始的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2411">40:11</a> 当我的人生OK或者不OK的时候，摄影都是我生活的补充</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入「FU友JI划」</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们相信，相机打开更多可能📸</span></p><span></span><p><span>以影像为起点，链接更多普通摄影爱好者的创作故事和他们鲜活的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也想分享你的拍摄故事和人生经历请大胆联系我！</span></p><span></span><p><span>wx：fh8042</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你今天也开心¯◡¯๑</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66265c2e7ebabfab6f23ffaf/lkf_K9HAw9RBLIKJbFTpFLHRoEYt.m4a" length="63908345" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqLtXuklG9N0WJ4ll2an78ELDPRQ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.08 | 俄乌冲突下的朝圣之旅，开启一场冒险扫街游戏</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cdb6f7e924d4525a66cac5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cdb6f7e924d4525a66cac5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Mar 2025 15:54:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期返场嘉宾：怪罐</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：奥利奥</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我和怪罐一同分享了各自在俄罗斯的拍照故事。尽管面临入境审查、语言障碍和极端天气，我们仍被俄罗斯的文化和自然美景深深吸引。讨论覆盖了莫斯科地铁的艺术、圣彼得堡的艺术氛围、以及在摩尔曼斯克观赏极光和与小浣熊的亲密接触等难忘时刻，拍到了很多印象深刻的照片。</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅行中的挑战虽然存在，但与自然和文化的深度连接使这些经历变得无价。无论是在冬天还是夏天，这个国家都能提供独特的旅行体验。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>嘉宾怪罐的照片故事</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoqaCwqfon500oqHqBBs-zav-_TA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>涅瓦河的游船上风很大</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhnCobtPdVciLqxHitvmy39gyznt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>涅瓦河畔的鸟比人自由</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj2-2u9OUVrQ36KTCdXd0807p9mg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>偶遇圣彼得堡日和彼得一世雕像</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuECIEiUg4CYHh3kyODXjl_NGoKE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>精神图腾：极地卫士阿廖沙</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhE5yoC-YrYf9xn7x8aItpL38k12.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>摩尔曼斯克的苏联遗风</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgQLMpXBkPvaFvNBv5wQE8vxdcHM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小浣熊体验中心里的“积极玩工”</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>主播奥利奥的照片故事</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv61rV2O2Pod4k4sa5DZ4bfgsa9n.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>和极光合影，人生照片+1</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk-8bWgWf_kwHIV3z5m2GIzQFXeM.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>极夜下摩尔曼斯克的绝美朝阳</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llSxxs8nwrqC4iI_fgmkfgcylxFH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>零下三十度莫斯科街头拉小提琴的lady</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkxQPhgx1JZ17i2-ZQ7I2oN1a73c.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>冬宫一扇绝美凌冽的窗花</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lh6c9qzbI429Gs5U1LRaF19bQdZj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>差点冲上去合影的俄罗斯逛博物馆girl</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>怪罐提到的老式的苏联时代游戏厅图片</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmtUMb487rCr6EcdfrjgKZa5-IwY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnzpBikzQdTaOfEK5XyCYyFe25vs.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1HLY2tZ-VpxW6HK9eWyfbRM6hZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqpGRwtsLUb0NsOR4G5jDRr_DPPH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpT57nyEqdcPLF19g1u6pgD0tNhh.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loL0b6f8Oyi8UoG4FznRumnJRNij.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>摩尔曼斯克地方知识博物馆里的展品，第一个是荒野乱斗里的英雄</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsynoWlENfZrMBcozebNPzmdE6ZK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>极昼下半夜2点的摩尔曼斯克</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuT1LS0qmQnNm8UABF0jyGGevziL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在摩尔曼斯克偶遇的演出</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入「FU友JI划」</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们相信，相机打开更多可能📸</span></p><span></span><p><span>每期用五张照片，走进摄影创作者背后那些决定性瞬间的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客嘉宾报名请添加wx：fh8042</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你今天也开心¯◡¯๑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjL84zX8Xih8mMYlX6nm6sL6mSgY.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66265c2e7ebabfab6f23ffaf/lpa7Fq8FipYw_klbw4wc9BjkAlmM.m4a" length="111003314" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpucAIcKrA6FSt4nhKcY9STjyJBo.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.07 | 行走、定格、感受（2024 Gap Year旅行特别版）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678f225ec3617f02a42cb36c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678f225ec3617f02a42cb36c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jan 2025 04:41:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这一期是无嘉宾版，2024年初我开启了gapyear，体验了长达一个多月的国外旅行，收获了很多让我生命中难以忘怀的经历，精选了一些我自己比较印象深刻的拍摄经历和照片故事与你分享，欢迎你的收听~！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 照片一：摩尔曼斯克极夜下的美到窒息的朝阳</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsA1rIgB49kg-nmD6N-q_v6bQOeI.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> 照片二：冬宫，一片美到极致凌冽的冰雪窗花</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkGgfOYUt8jQadW5A98MYVBdcipX.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 照片三：伊斯坦布尔街头，加入一场猫猫加密对话</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj_9DFQISfTB6ntiMdLIIGKcIa45.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="561">09:21</a> 照片四：阴天重感冒，在海边吹风，眺望蓝色大清真寺</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llosRf2xApSC7-HZxWhLZXkiffk6.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="652">10:52</a> 照片五：伊斯坦布尔街角专注的艺术家Lady，平静美好</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loYimMqqguWG04qY5giVcLD_8QWw.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="722">12:02</a> 照片六：在阿布扎比大清真寺，定格幸福</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsSz-yo1ZAXNRMDG6wuIypN44tLf.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a> 照片七：迪拜朱美拉海滩看了一场完美日落</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljqw6qIQbADFuuM9ZI5bG_aJuRY5.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> 照片八：京都夜晚游荡中不合时宜的“偷窥”一场聚会</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvL38ZTYU4_5xzCIpsaYodJl_R_3.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> 照片九：居酒屋的小窗户，一次惊慌的拍摄</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvurnxQ8BmXVDn9fTpQsNcxLNjJ1.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">19:19</a> 照片十：樱花、东京铁塔、蓝天，快乐追樱的一天</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lv7cDVriBYMgYDAvL_cyL-thbTYe.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> 照片十一：浅草寺前不敢靠近的一对情侣</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lg_U7QfqZqS_PyMXB8544iEDH5w8.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 照片十二：在宇治街头等待一个自行车女孩，点亮了我的那天好心情</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpT6Mj4sCefAr4UovkeOCXZLci5j.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a> 照片十三：代代木公园里的泡泡机女孩，合影成功！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luewkFSC8w1aXwmAShv_4s0zYZCX.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> 照片十四：夕阳下，街头偶遇一群下课女学生</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnXs89jdoom4xi4UW-qu48s_uQRY.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 照片十五：躲进泉州老社区猛拍，一条巷子尽头的门</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrUdHB2utP-DCw8J5ytWkPHEcugc.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a> 照片十六：鼓浪屿轮渡上窗外的夫妻与凝视</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lioHbcAzatLx3pBP0sNWcJauvUm0.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">35:28</a> 照片十七：在中山，一张油画感的凳子令我流连忘返</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsct9qp4ca2oCXZQZdbl-HEcAdBL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a> 照片十八：和海浪嬉戏，拥抱，雀跃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqt2n8jEiM_7Jq5aVT6YLUgq6Hxw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2461">41:01</a> 生活是需要平凡时刻去支撑的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a> 永远不要丧失对记录生活的表达欲和好奇心</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入「FU友JI划」</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们相信，相机打开更多可能📸</span></p><span></span><p><span>每张“好”照片都值得被看见和倾听：）</span></p><span></span><p><span>想和我碰头请添加wx：fh8042</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝你今天也开心¯◡¯๑</span></p>]]></description>
