  <item>
    <title>VOL.04 | “我是感觉至上主义，拍照也是。”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670627c96c7f817786c0cbf6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670627c96c7f817786c0cbf6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Oct 2024 06:50:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主持人| 奥利奥</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑制作 | Lachure</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span><strong><span>小虎</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>生活在珠海的医务工作者，还在子宫里的时候食欲就很好。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtKjJL_X5LTRxy6RptixvTIkf4bS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljGfioWFXWQmW9L_D7DRuYssjzqH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>相机型号：XT30II</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 从vlog到播客：一段偶然的链接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 街头摄影中的温情与灵感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="476">07:56</a> 从失落到发现：一次深夜街头摄影之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a> 摄影与台球：追求过程的乐趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">17:21</a> 探索自我与兴趣：跨专业挑战与个人成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1291">21:31</a> 医护人员的真实生活：查房与意外惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">26:32</a> 通过工作小仪式感与个人习惯提升生活质量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1899">31:39</a> 探索内在与建立顺畅人际关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">35:14</a> 珠海：慢生活与宜居城市的魅力</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>五张照片故事分享：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>#关于扫街</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>摄于香港。</span></p><span></span><p><span>海雾在夜晚登陆，远处的高楼再次笼在雾里，高处灯光是一团团变换的彩色。空气里湿的感觉贴住裸露在外的皮肤。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn3lTRnxnrU3Tz_wH8La9Z0nbWXW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>拿着相机穿梭香港街头观察人类。或新或旧的大楼林立，包围街景里构筑香港日常，再用取景器截取片段。香港的气质是怡然自得，那天的每一缕阳光都碎落成宝石收藏在心中。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FicpKi0RYeA31iDtaXB7RKEcfm-e.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>#关于情绪</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>在心情不美丽的夜晚出门扫街，抓取的画面是心情的表达。情绪流动，由心转入画面，便是自释了。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loNWwwuOQvte4IoZAfujP6NrC1Hn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>#关于抓拍</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>一张天时地利人和的抓拍，摄于公交车靠窗座位。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每个人都是一面镜子，见人时亦窥见自己。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnrJVh8pn5Ooyjl6EjyTmUiB1TLZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>#关于人像</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>2023.8／初初几次人像拍摄都获得了不错的评价，然而我却似乎陷入了拍摄人像的漩涡，这只是一种技术尝试，我却冠以过高的定位，来局限自己，逼迫自己，明明我的摄影初心并非于此，却用功利心把自己陷入了身心俱疲的深坑。于是沉寂，调整状态，和朋友在阴天的海边再度拿出了令自己满意的答案。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjGTqnK5gt7ENORVDY57jGqK-gkX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入「</span><strong><span>FU友JI划</span></strong><span>」</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们相信，相机打开更多可能📸</span></p><span></span><p><span>还可以在小红书找到我们：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/61911c2d0000000010009189?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=61911c2d0000000010009189&amp;apptime=1728455393" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/61911c2d0000000010009189?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=61911c2d0000000010009189&amp;apptime=1728455393"><span>FU友JI划</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>祝你今天也开心¯◡¯๑</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lk9pDyI_uMP4GTCxIvYaL4njSNSa.m4a" length="57642104" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrvbXwg8tv9Ilh4QWPunfGrGxrka.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
