  <item>
    <title>VOL.01 | 玩富士的程序员才是好的摄影师</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66573467721e31720b8c44a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66573467721e31720b8c44a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 May 2024 13:57:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>本期嘉宾：阿豐</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><span>99年，台湾人，鹅厂非典型程序员，宝可梦爱好者，热爱旅行。</span></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>小红书： &nbsp;</span></em><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/608589d90000000001005bc8" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/608589d90000000001005bc8"><span>阿豐FENG</span></a></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>（PS：一个有趣健谈且优秀的单身小哥哥，姐妹们快冲~！）</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp3ohqgyGLe0I2ZSrHfhkfSdd26H.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnlwmfDblM6UjiZGqYpj5EOvotpx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>相机型号：X-S20</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客你将会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> 我是北京长大的台湾人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">02:52</a> 开始接触摄影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> 人生第一台相机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a> 第二台富士相机的购买经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a> 跟九只哈士奇一起拍照是什么体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">12:33</a> 难忘的潜水经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> 没有班味的程序员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">15:26</a> 趁年轻要多去看世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">18:16</a> 摄影对于我的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> 来自台湾本地人的旅游攻略指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> 第一次和四个陌生妹子的合照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 在洞爷湖拍下的人生照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1792">29:52</a> 和陌生人交换生日贺卡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>照片故事：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhHtF9THK9SGCIka5UkQT9UPo2Ci.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>白色恋人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>摄于北海道白色恋人公园。在门口遇到需要帮忙拍照的日本女生，帮她们拍完照片后，逛完公园发现又遇见了她们，果断向前询问能否合影，便留下了这个瞬间。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgfd1ozbtR05yCD6FJAPLFxyn4S-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>洞爷湖</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>摄于北海道洞爷湖。凌晨泡温泉看日出后，一只有一片积云附着在羊蹄山上方，导致心中总是抱憾。在去了g8洞爷湖高峰会博物馆之后，突然看到云雾散尽，雪白的羊蹄山就展露在我面前，便迅速拿起相机，刚好有船悄悄驶过点缀着，拍下这美丽的瞬间。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lu90cXnzgOZ0wYH-x4je0P1JV658.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>生日卡片</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>摄于香港艺术馆。你有多久没收到别人手画的生日祝福卡片了呢。在这里可以接受别人给你的生日祝福卡片，并手画一张自己给别人的生日祝福卡片，通过这种方式，让快乐与爱意传递下去。</span></p><span></span><p><span>—————————————————————————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入「FU友JI划」，我们的目标是保持“富”有！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>相机打开更多可能。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群/活动报名请加wx：fh8042</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loO5W-w8_WQPmKlWFw--1wwwjmZ4.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsyzPCBGRZHM-DgPnOknLBxBBykg.m4a" length="64218865" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmXOUUpFLtK3s3z9HuPmsr0Cdx_f.png"/>
